**13 new tests across 3 phases:**

| Phase | Tests | Result |
|-------|-------|--------|
| 1. Movie-path error branches | 5 (slow-path throw, fast-path throw, notification for movie/episode, no notify on failure) | All pass |
| 2. Multi-file torrents | 3 (mixed match, organizer doesn't abort batch, non-video files) + **bug fix** | All pass |
| 3. Retry & path resolution | 3 (missing path throws, path preference, empty sourcePath throws) | All pass |

